    "Names of the dvarapanditas: Ratnakarashanti at the eastern gate, Vagishvarakirti at the western gate, Naropa at the northern gate, Prajnakaramati at the southern gate, Ratnavajra at the first central gate and Jnanashrimitra at the second central gate.",
